00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:08.443
(audience laughing softly)

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.276
- But that's awesome, though.

00:01:09.276 --> 00:01:10.109
It's a female cast,

00:01:10.109 --> 00:01:12.010
that's what I love about the
movie it's this female cast,

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:12.843
you're all just kicking butt.

00:01:12.843 --> 00:01:13.810
Did y'all get really close?

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.510
- [Jurnee] Oh, we had so
much fun it was incredible

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.000
